<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 11/12.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 11/12.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Monday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for August 12. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   12.08.97	  11.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.3560	    6.3628</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1558	    2.1360</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.2422	    4.2078</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4710	    3.3740</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5034	    0.4967</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7216	    0.7132</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2697	    0.2673</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8265	    6.7653</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6888	    0.6882</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1531	    1.1400</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
